  "categorias": "Deportes|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>(18 fotos) El sal&oacute;n de actos de la Caja Rural de Onda ha acogido la tarde de este mi&eacute;rcoles una charla de Ricardo Ten, trainer paral&iacute;mpico, sobre el tema &lsquo;Vivir superando l&iacute;mites&rsquo;.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/12/IMG_3899.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Han presentado al conferenciante Salvador Calzada Feliu, presidente de la entidad, y &nbsp;Ram&oacute;n M&eacute;ndez de Vigo, responsable de relaciones institucionales de Seguros RGA, que ha patrocinado el evento.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/12/IMG_3909.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Ten ha sido 12 veces campe&oacute;n de Europa, siete veces campe&oacute;n del mundo y en tres ocasiones ganador de la Paraolimp&iacute;ada. Entre el p&uacute;blico que llenaba completamente la sala estaba el club Adaponda al completo, con Pepe Ramos Castillo, ex-nadador paral&iacute;mpico ondense y amigo personal del conferenciante.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciaricardotentrainerparalimpiccajaruralonda/img_3893.jpg\" alt=\"img_3893\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciaricardotentrainerparalimpiccajaruralonda/img_3894.jpg\" alt=\"img_3894\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciaricardotentrainerparalimpiccajaruralonda/img_3896.jpg\" alt=\"img_3896\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciaricardotentrainerparalimpiccajaruralonda/img_3898.jpg\" alt=\"img_3898\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciaricardotentrainerparalimpiccajaruralonda/img_3899.jpg\" alt=\"img_3899\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciaricardotentrainerparalimpiccajaruralonda/img_3901.jpg\" alt=\"img_3901\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciaricardotentrainerparalimpiccajaruralonda/img_3909.jpg\" alt=\"img_3909\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciaricardotentrainerparalimpiccajaruralonda/img_3910.jpg\" alt=\"img_3910\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciaricardotentrainerparalimpiccajaruralonda/img_3911.jpg\" alt=\"img_3911\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciaricardotentrainerparalimpiccajaruralonda/img_3914.jpg\" alt=\"img_3914\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciaricardotentrainerparalimpiccajaruralonda/img_3915.jpg\" alt=\"img_3915\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciaricardotentrainerparalimpiccajaruralonda/img_3918.jpg\" alt=\"img_3918\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciaricardotentrainerparalimpiccajaruralonda/img_3921.jpg\" alt=\"img_3921\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciaricardotentrainerparalimpiccajaruralonda/img_3922.jpg\" alt=\"img_3922\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciaricardotentrainerparalimpiccajaruralonda/img_3926.jpg\" alt=\"img_3926\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src